# supercronic crontab — one line per scheduled job.
#
# Times are UTC (the container has no TZ set). supercronic logs each run to
# stdout, so `docker compose logs analytics` is the whole story.
#
# The real analytics cadences arrive with issues #12-#14. 15 minutes is a
# scaffold value: frequent enough to see it working, harmless because the job
# takes an advisory lock and skips if a previous run is still going.

*/15 * * * * hello
